    "detailed_description": "Tetram is a game that uses mechanics from the famous falling block game mixed with memorization and spatial location. This is a challenging game that will require all of your attention because with the slightest carelessness, you will lose the match.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring the game, your goal will be to fit the blocks to make lines, eliminating them. When all the blocks on the board are eliminated, the game's difficulty increases, and a new game starts with a random arrangement of new blocks on the board.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you will never have identical matches because with each new attempt, you will be presented with a level design generated entirely randomly. Therefore, your fun will be unlimited.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a game with easy-to-learn mechanics but with strategically challenging obstacles to master.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShow that you are quick, have a good spatial sense, and know how to assemble blocks to achieve an increasingly higher score on the leaderboard and always maintain the record.",
    "about_the_game": "Tetram is a game that uses mechanics from the famous falling block game mixed with memorization and spatial location. This is a challenging game that will require all of your attention because with the slightest carelessness, you will lose the match.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring the game, your goal will be to fit the blocks to make lines, eliminating them. When all the blocks on the board are eliminated, the game's difficulty increases, and a new game starts with a random arrangement of new blocks on the board.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you will never have identical matches because with each new attempt, you will be presented with a level design generated entirely randomly. Therefore, your fun will be unlimited.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a game with easy-to-learn mechanics but with strategically challenging obstacles to master.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShow that you are quick, have a good spatial sense, and know how to assemble blocks to achieve an increasingly higher score on the leaderboard and always maintain the record.",
    "short_description": "TETRAM is a blend of mechanics reminiscent of classic block games with card memorization and spatial location. It's an innovative mechanic for those who enjoy games with similar gameplay.",
